title: The Israel of God – Israel, the Church and Zionism
description: Israel and the Israel of God: Abraham's seed is Christ, the church is the Israel of God, continuation not replacement, all Israel saved in Christ, Zionism and dispensationalism refuted, and the judgment on unbelieving Jerusalem, from the teachings on Israel.
output: lessons/doctrine/topic-israel.html
highlight: Israel; seed

# One deck for the doctrine "Israel & the Israel of God" (150 teachings), its themes given equal weight.
# Slide text is the author's own sentences, trimmed. The verses the teachings typed out are shown from the KJV.

=== Introduction
--- The Israel of God [title]
overline: Doctrine · Israel & the Israel of God
heading: The Israel of God
sub: Who Israel is, the church, and Zionism.
refs: Galatians 6:16; Galatians 3:29; Romans 9:6-8; Romans 2:28-29; Romans 11:26
hint: Use the arrow keys or swipe to move. Tap any gold reference to read the verse.

# from 16879, 11588
--- He is a Jew, which is one inwardly
big: Romans 2:28-29 | mark: he is a Jew, which is one inwardly; and circumcision is that of the heart
p: Jews, modern people calling themselves Jews, are defined by their rejection of Jesus as the Christ. Regardless of genetic background, origin story, current ideology or religion, a Jew is defined by their utter rejection of Christ and the God of their fathers.
p: And by this, they are as the unfaithful wife, gone a whoring after false gods, Whose Husband has put them away and taken to Him another people, who believe on His word ([[Jeremiah 3:8]]).
read: app:doctrine-israel~11588 | A Jew is defined by rejecting Christ

=== Abraham's seed is Christ
# from 4437, 6777, 6882, 17974
--- To thy seed, which is Christ
kicker: Abraham's seed
big: Galatians 3:16 | mark: And to thy seed, which is Christ
p: The promise to Abraham was both for the land, and the Christ. Long before the exodus, before Isaac was ever born. The blessings were made to him and his seed. Not seeds, plural. Jesus Christ.
p: Zionism is a modern political ideology that takes the promise to Abraham, and rather than give the inheritance to Christ and all who are in Christ, gives it to unbelieving, apostate Jews. This is the promise to Abraham. Not for the modern Jew. Not for the apostate and wicked modern state calling itself Israel.

# from 7166, 14832, 6944
--- If ye be Christ's
kicker: Abraham's seed
big: Galatians 3:28-29 | mark: if ye be Christ’s, then are ye Abraham’s seed, and heirs according to the promise
p: All of the nations in the world descended from Abraham, and intermarried, and spread out on the Earth ([[1 Chronicles 1:27-34]]). And the blessing of Abraham's seed was to Christ, and if you be in Christ, you are of Abraham's seed. There is no Jew or Greek. All men are called.
p: Circumcision of the flesh was a picture of the sealing of a soul by the Holy Spirit to come. The circumcision of the heart, made without hands ([[Colossians 2:11]]).

# from 4622, 4623, 16480
--- Fellowheirs
kicker: Abraham's seed
big: Ephesians 3:6 | mark: That the Gentiles should be fellowheirs, and of the same body
p: The mystery: how God would bless all nations in Abraham's seed, Jesus. Paul puts to bed the notion that Gentile believers are somehow less-than in their inheritance. We are the second born who received the full inheritance and blessing.
p: Even in Ezekiel's vision the strangers among them receive the same inheritance ([[Ezekiel 47:22-23]]). It was never exclusive to the Jews. Never. It was always about those circumcised of the heart and believing on Christ.
read: app:doctrine-israel~4437 | Abraham's seed is Christ, and believers are heirs
read: app:doctrine-israel~14832 | All nations from Abraham, and his seed is Christ
read: app:doctrine-israel~16480 | The inheritance was never exclusive to the Jews

=== The church is the Israel of God
# from 15327, 12368, 11137, 11809
--- A remnant according to the election of grace
kicker: The Israel of God
big: Romans 11:5 | mark: there is a remnant according to the election of grace
p: It isn't by ethnicity or nation that God saves or condemns, but by belief and unbelieving. *God hath not cast away his people which he foreknew* ([[Romans 11:2]]) is conditional: His people that are saved.
p: Under the Old Testament there were periods where, of the millions of Israelites, as few as 7,000 had called upon the name of the Lord and were saved ([[1 Kings 19:18]]). Strait is the gate and narrow the way and few there are that find it.

# from 10857, 10858, 12372
--- And so all Israel shall be saved
kicker: The Israel of God
big: Romans 9:6-8 | mark: For they are not all Israel, which are of Israel; the children of the promise are counted for the seed
p: Here is the crux of the dispensationalist heresy. Their main proof text. “All Israel shall be saved” ([[Romans 11:26]]). But this is not Israel of the flesh. A deliverer comes out of Zion, to turn away ungodliness from Jacob. That is Christ Jesus.
p: God's promises were kept in Christ. The remnant is in Christ. All Israel was saved, in Christ. The Kingdom, the land that was promised, is through Christ. The blessings were to the seed, and that seed is singular.

# from 10887, 10890, 10891, 12369, 12370, 12371
--- Broken off, grafted in
kicker: The Israel of God
big: Romans 11:20 | mark: because of unbelief they were broken off, and thou standest by faith
p: Old Testament Israel and New Testament Israel, Hebrew or Gentile, all were saved by faith. Wild olive branches grafted in to the root. Boast not against the branches. We shouldn't fall to the same arrogance as the unbelieving Jews. There is no Jew or Greek in Christ.
p: Note the conditional statements. IF we continue in belief, we remain in His goodness, and IF the Jew abides not in unbelief, they will be graft back in ([[Romans 11:22-23]]). Provoked to jealousy by the mercy shown believers, *that I might save some of them* ([[Romans 11:14]]).

# from 11712, 12320, 10244, 2619
--- Continuation, not replacement
kicker: The Israel of God
big: John 15:5-6 | mark: I am the vine, ye are the branches
p: They call it “replacement theology,” but it is actually a continuation theology, the same promise offered by the same grace, through faith in the same Christ. There is no replacement theology, only the continuation of the covenant made to Abraham, which is to all nations ([[Romans 4:16]]).
p: The entire Bible teaches the one faith of salvation in Christ. The idea of their being special or chosen as a race, outside of Christ, is unbiblical fiction. And for this truth, they seek to kill us. Because they hated Christ first.

# from 9702, 6300, 12681, 12739
--- The vineyard given to others
kicker: The Israel of God
big: Luke 20:16 | mark: and shall give the vineyard to others
p: The vineyard, being His covenant, and the fruit thereof His people: the care of that covenant taken from the rebellious husbandmen and given to others. It is not some newfound doctrine, or some Pauline heresy. It is the will of God the Father.
p: The fig tree withered from the roots: the taking away of the Kingdom for failing to provide fruit ([[Mark 11:20]]). The Bible is a book of winnowing. The eldest may receive the inheritance of earthly things, but the Kingdom of Heaven is only inherited by faith.

# from 7445, 7192, 7193
--- Spiritually Edom
kicker: The Israel of God
big: Hebrews 12:16-17 | mark: who for one morsel of meat sold his birthright
p: Like Esau, Jews sought an earthly kingdom from an earthly messiah, to satisfy their fleshly desires. They sold their birthright by choosing to kill Christ. The Jews who killed Jesus and the prophets are spiritually Edom. The wrath of God abides upon them to the uttermost.
p: Dispensationalist Christians who give them honor as “older brothers” so despise their birthright in Christ they are willing to give it up to Jews for a morsel. For less than a bowl of pottage. There is no genetic or ethnic role in salvation.

# from 15881, 15874, 17975, 17971
--- Surnamed by the name of Israel
kicker: The Israel of God
big: Isaiah 44:5 | mark: surname himself by the name of Israel
p: A prophecy of Christians, made sons of God and co-heirs with Christ. Those called by His name. We become the elect of Israel by adoption ([[Romans 8:15-17]]).
p: The only “Zionism” that matters is Christ Jesus on His throne. Zion, like believers stained crimson in sin, has a redeemer, and is His bride ([[Revelation 21:2]]). The spirit of Esau lives in Christians who for political expediency seek to give the inheritance away.
read: app:doctrine-israel~12372 | And so all Israel shall be saved
read: app:doctrine-israel~10891 | Until the fulness of the Gentiles be come in
read: app:doctrine-israel~11712 | Continuation theology, not replacement theology
read: app:doctrine-israel~7193 | Dispensationalists selling the birthright to spiritual Edom

=== Zionism refuted
# from 10196, 14682, 8633, 7443
--- If ye will obey
kicker: Zionism refuted
big: Hebrews 8:9 | mark: because they continued not in my covenant, and I regarded them not, saith the Lord
p: God judges nations on earth by their works. He judges people as individuals by their faith. His promises to nations are conditional, if/then ([[Exodus 19:5]]). Hebrews 8:9 is one of many silver bullets. The Jews continued not in His covenant AND I REGARDED THEM NOT.
p: So many dispensationalists rest their Zionism on “God keeps His promises!” with no understanding that covenants have conditions. Edom was given Seir, and God took their land and made it desolate ([[Obadiah 1:10]]).

# from 14480, 15624, 14619, 13913
--- For David's sake and Jerusalem's
kicker: Zionism refuted
big: 1 Kings 11:13 | mark: for David my servant’s sake, and for Jerusalem’s sake which I have chosen
p: Notice that it is not the Judeans whom God is concerned with. The covenant the Lord made is with David, and His concern is with keeping Jerusalem because that is where God chose to place His name; Christ Jesus.
p: God is not bound to always be with Israel after the flesh. The times that the Lord saved Israel after the flesh were solely due to Christ, His Seed. Nothing else made them any different from the other peoples of the earth ([[1 Samuel 4:3-11]]).

# from 16386, 16380, 16334
--- Not 1948
kicker: Zionism refuted
big: Ezekiel 37:12-14 | mark: I will open your graves, and cause you to come up out of your graves
p: The valley of dry bones is one of the clearest prophecies of the resurrection and millennial kingdom of believers, ruled as one nation under *David my servant*, Christ Jesus ([[Ezekiel 37:24]]).
p: The new heart is not fulfilled by the UN creating the modern state of Israel. They have not gotten a new heart. They have not accepted Christ ([[Ezekiel 36:26]]). *Abraham was one... but we are many* ([[Ezekiel 33:24]]) is the argument made by Jews today. The basis of Zionism.

# from 16267, 17830, 15694
--- The Jews were never the heroes
kicker: Zionism refuted
big: Acts 7:51 | mark: Ye stiffnecked and uncircumcised in heart and ears, ye do always resist the Holy Ghost
p: It is impossible to read the prophets and come away with the idea that the Jews are generally the good guys. They were always a stiff-necked rebellious people who needed to be punished to do right, and even then rarely repented.
p: The modern form of Jewish ethnic supremacy, that as God's chosen people it is because of their own qualities and holiness, is wicked. God is not a respecter of persons ([[Romans 2:11]]).

# from 15162, 8179, 7773
--- Shouldest thou help the ungodly?
kicker: Zionism refuted
big: 2 Chronicles 19:2 | mark: Shouldest thou help the ungodly, and love them that hate the LORD?
p: If God's wrath is upon unbelieving Jews to the uttermost, how much more those that place them as our “greatest allies”? Zionist evangelical Republican types are ultranationalists, but for a foreign people, not their own.
p: They give another gospel, a dispensation of race to a people the Bible calls a synagogue of Satan ([[Revelation 2:9]]). HINT: they call themselves Jews and meet in synagogues. The tribulation they gave the early churches has never stopped.

# from 12228, 8041, 8060, 15965
--- No third temple, no role in the end
kicker: Zionism refuted
big: Revelation 2:9 | mark: which say they are Jews, and are not, but are the synagogue of Satan
p: Forget everything you've ever heard about the Jews and their role in end times prophecy, and let the Bible speak. God isn't waiting on them to build a third temple. The third temple is Christ and the body of believers. Anything they build will be an abomination.
p: The woman of Revelation 12 is not modern Israel; Scofield, that viper, is a primary source of this, and his notes have deceived millions. What unbelieving Jews and Muslims do on the temple mount doesn't matter. It is the Lord's and He will repay.

# from 12294, 12373, 11007, 2840
--- Dispensationalism falls apart
kicker: Zionism refuted
big: Romans 3:29-30 | mark: Is he the God of the Jews only? is he not also of the Gentiles?
p: Anyone who tries to justify Dispensationalism has to make each argument in a vacuum, stripping proof texts from their surrounding meaning. When we compare scripture to scripture, their doctrines fall apart. It is why their false teachers discourage reading the Bible yourself.
p: The alms for Jerusalem went to the saved believers in a famine, not to just any Jews ([[Acts 11:28-30]]). Do not get your doctrine from people who are vehemently anti-God and who despise Jesus.
read: app:doctrine-israel~8633 | I Regarded Them Not
read: app:doctrine-israel~16386 | The dry bones are the resurrection, not 1948
read: app:doctrine-israel~12228 | The Jews have no role in end times prophecy
read: app:doctrine-israel~12373 | Dispensationalism falls apart by comparing scripture

=== Judgment on unbelieving Jerusalem
# from 16186, 10615, 14683
--- A bill of divorcement
kicker: Unbelieving Jerusalem
big: Ezekiel 16:48 | mark: Sodom thy sister hath not done, she nor her daughters, as thou hast done
p: Ezekiel 16 reads as a writ of divorce. God breaking up with her, in a spiritual metaphor. This is a bill of divorcement, and should give the Zionist dispensationalist crowd cause to repent.
p: The Lord rejected ALL the seed of Israel ([[2 Kings 17:20]]). Judah was kept from utter destruction only until the promise of Christ came.

# from 9804, 9459, 5627, 2988
--- His blood be on us
kicker: Unbelieving Jerusalem
big: Matthew 27:25 | mark: His blood be on us, and on our children
p: The multitudes of the Jews brought Jesus to Pilate that the Romans may kill Him for them. This Biblical truth is considered “antisemitic blood libel” today, in many supposed Christian churches. Priests and pastors blame the Romans for the death of Christ.
p: *Behold, your house is left unto you desolate* ([[Luke 13:35]]). The lie that the disciples stole His body *is commonly reported among the Jews until this day* ([[Matthew 28:15]]). They've formed an entire identity and religion out of denying the resurrection.

# from 5650, 12554, 8045
--- Wrath to the uttermost
kicker: Unbelieving Jerusalem
big: 1 Thessalonians 2:15-16 | mark: for the wrath is come upon them to the uttermost
p: This is still true of the Jews today, regardless of the origin story we might believe. Edomite, Khazarian, Ashkenaz, Cain, Canaanite; Adamic or not. God's wrath is upon them to the uttermost, because they do not please Him, and forbid us to speak to the Gentiles. They are a synagogue of Satan.
p: Crucified in 30 AD; forty years later, 70 AD, Jerusalem destroyed. A generation left to die in the wilderness ([[Numbers 14:33-34]]; [[Luke 21:20-22]]).
read: app:doctrine-israel~16186 | God's writ of divorce to Jerusalem
