=== Peace upon the Israel of God
--- The Israel of God [title]
overline: Israel & the Israel of God
heading: Peace upon the Israel of God
big: Galatians 6:15-16 | mark: peace be on them, and mercy, and upon the Israel of God
center: The promise is to the faithful. There is no Jew or Greek. Whosoever believeth on Him shall not be ashamed.
